{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1037_020meg", "source_sha256": "badf99b3f76c8b17c834454a37a26c1d3e4ad62b1f57d69c9da681aa60810fb5", "ja": "それよりさ～、聞いたよ可奈！　新しい曲を\nどっちが歌うか、志保と勝負してるんだって？", "zh": "话说回来～可奈，我听说啰！\n你正在跟志保争新歌要由谁来唱啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "45778ac01f56e619d7afb9e4185ad1ba88eb7a2f00ae86c0fd9b8bc13679c883", "ja": "ん……杏奈も、してる……。\n可奈と……志保には……負けない……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈也有份……\n杏奈不会……输给可奈……跟志保……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1039_036kan", "source_sha256": "5e588f1eff7c01997269f46f09c0002aafd40fd5718b99247422d0c54ada0cec", "ja": "わわ、私だって、まだまだあきらめないよっ！", "zh": "我我、我也还没放弃喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1040_020meg", "source_sha256": "fc0336de94fbbc10357f05a2c6deb6940e31d91f7ac030d13400c92cd731290b", "ja": "にゃははっ♪　ふたりとも熱いね～。", "zh": "呀哈哈♪你们真是热血啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1041_020meg", "source_sha256": "bf9c05867756144dc1b55c98b8e080c2c5e3769140e498f24fe6492ddc6bc112", "ja": "ま、仲間同士でも、譲れないコトってあるもんね。\nライバルって感じで、いいんじゃない？", "zh": "不过，就算是伙伴，也是有不能退让的时候呢。\n这样彼此较劲的感觉，我觉得很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1042_037nao", "source_sha256": "154c87034eb3ee6c8955944650d4f71286c364750ec2dd7570222e181323e32c", "ja": "せやな。同じステージに立つアイドル同士の争い……。\nなんや、メッチャ熱い展開やんな！", "zh": "就是啊。站在同个舞台的偶像们互相竞争……\n这个发展真让人热血沸腾啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1043_037nao", "source_sha256": "e7aad2bdea6f61e6c67536c9cf066923fdaa8a80de9272f9a80e6cd7b2e5b8fa", "ja": "なぁなぁ、可奈、杏奈。\n私もレッスン、混ぜてくれへん？", "zh": "欸欸，可奈、杏奈。\n我可不可以一起练习呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1044_020meg", "source_sha256": "d7579f6fe4df936ef7864a2922c0f72eb4762e9947d0176615059eb7d003ae27", "ja": "あっ、アタシもアタシも♪\nこんな面白そうなコト、乗らないワケいかないっしょ！", "zh": "啊，我也要我也要♪\n这么有趣的事情，我怎么能错过呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1045_036kan", "source_sha256": "1eb00fada70dc8b0928d1ad6e624cfb167d14483d17097bd237e2ae0922e96ce", "ja": "もちろんいいですよ！　みんなで練習～うれしいな～♪\n力を合わせて、頑張りましょうっ！", "zh": "当然好啊！大家一起练习～好开心喔～♪\n我们一起合力加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1046_033sih", "source_sha256": "ddd35ddb8f192d2211eac1f65924d48619122743552e88a95ab0af7dcf2c6cb5", "ja": "力を合わせるのはいいけど、音が外れているわ。\n本当にちゃんとレッスンしてたの？　可奈。", "zh": "要合力当然好，但你走音了。\n可奈，你真的有好好在练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1047_036kan", "source_sha256": "a116345ce31f07db74802dc62754adcfc33a79a3e61ef73891ec7a9875bd1cb0", "ja": "はれっ、志保ちゃん！？\nれ、レッスンしたよぉ～ちゃんと！", "zh": "咦？志保！？\n我、我当然有～好好练啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1048_p", "source_sha256": "120a50fe710f8206c8bc15c1a01fe8c780f5b82e03e3831a9b0a92f964f775f0", "ja": "志保、お疲れさま。\n今日は遅かったんだな。", "zh": "志保，辛苦了。\n你今天比较晚到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "c905e32097e37e3cb76d9cc88097a330b6a72fd698b7fc11204989333c8a658f", "ja": "すみません。\n学校の用事が、なかなか終わらなくて……。", "zh": "不好意思，\n学校的事情迟迟没办法结束……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1050_033sih", "source_sha256": "26cac2481b9cbbfb6a65e7840d9c9929cb2b8c43140e87f375667076c4299ceb", "ja": "でも、大丈夫です。\n遅れた分は、今から取り戻しますから。", "zh": "不过，你不用担心。\n我现在就把落后的进度补回来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1051_024ann", "source_sha256": "a9363794c491c1b67ca9dacb62f99c65e7b2d983be5372bdf8253402ed8e559b", "ja": "志保……やる気、だね……。", "zh": "志保……很有干劲……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1052_033sih", "source_sha256": "7f34cad32c9301282f132546666ff4b0f50d095057193fa81c5fec44386d23fd", "ja": "当然よ。{$P$}さんに、\n新しい曲を歌うのは私だって、認めてもらわなくちゃ。", "zh": "这是当然。我可要让{$P$}先生\n认可我才是新歌主唱的唯一人选。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1053_033sih", "source_sha256": "a014d247cb88657c2545424c8ea16a2ec412af33e96ef433ffddae0e084a1c60", "ja": "奈緒さんと恵美さんも、参加するんですか？\nでも私、負ける気はありませんから。", "zh": "奈绪和惠美也要参加是吗？\n我是不会输给你们的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1054_037nao", "source_sha256": "8775653c9eb905106ee56c617ff0322aa921591e5721c6d94e1857797240a4f4", "ja": "おお！　志保、めっちゃバチバチしてるやん！\nでもなぁ……。", "zh": "喔喔！志保感觉战力十足！\n不过啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1055_037nao", "source_sha256": "a105eb3321daa6bb1c2045e74811e6ce97e4ead5b69998df577b82a43e11ecf3", "ja": "私も、そう簡単に引き下がるつもりはないで！", "zh": "我也不打算这么简单就退下喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1056_033sih", "source_sha256": "2b56157a1a117f83510fba647b2798456bb55d79cc530dd85cf3a32403e7129d", "ja": "わかってますよ。\n勝負なんですから、当然です。", "zh": "我知道。\n我们毕竟是在较量，这是当然的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1057_020meg", "source_sha256": "40f08fc7ee778f212434438b881a4375e943a926703dc5c54209f70a26b24a0b", "ja": "んも～、奈緒も志保も、落ち着きなって！\n熱くなるのはいいけど、ケンカはダメだっての！", "zh": "唉唷～奈绪跟志保都冷静一点！\n热血是没关系，但你们可不能吵架！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1058_020meg", "source_sha256": "09186b18f098353bb58bb076dde0b7f44f46fcaeb9c0f50f09f2129805490c05", "ja": "でも。どうしてもって言うなら……\nアタシを殴ってからにしなよー！", "zh": "不过，你们非得吵架的话……\n就先揍我一拳吧──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1059_037nao", "source_sha256": "9c15894d13ff8982462ea291b50f8e601976af46515f842a14521c15c2133d0f", "ja": "いや、私の方が先や！\nせやけど志保、顔はやめてな！　アイドルやからな！", "zh": "不，先揍我才对啦！\n可是志保，不要打脸喔！大家都是偶像嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1060_024ann", "source_sha256": "da0d328e44a4bba3e63b3da1dcbb447ceffc9a98f4d5f3ecc08fa6ab5435c263", "ja": "グーは……よくない……です……。", "zh": "杏奈觉得……用拳头……不好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1061_p", "source_sha256": "d1f984639a648fbdbcb9ee210f165555f76962577dfdfc2e81b14e5bdd77dfdb", "ja": "一応言っておくけど、パーもダメだからな？", "zh": "我先声明，用巴掌也不行喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1062_036kan", "source_sha256": "ab1a4bc1c633e1ac341ff9a37801cffaf55817e91148b111b7be4a0daa10f065", "ja": "志保ちゃん、学校の用事お疲れさま！\n自主練、私達と一緒にしようよっ！", "zh": "志保，学校的事辛苦你了！\n跟我们一起自主练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1063_033sih", "source_sha256": "dee216991141dac2a3e3709042380196b1fd753148db0f00e71dbf87fac981dc", "ja": "……どうして？\n私達、今、ライバルなのよ。", "zh": "……为什么？\n我们现在可是竞争对手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1064_036kan", "source_sha256": "d32c393295c9071245c8995b744b874b595c4f109e7001bc8039e94d17df8976", "ja": "ライバル……だけど、ほら友達だし！", "zh": "竞争对手……可是，我们也是朋友啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1065_033sih", "source_sha256": "09fdeb7b29b42f5f94a1370f700504d6c5c0906cc67d6649c0a434d2ddfac7d1", "ja": "友達の前に、ライバルが先だと思うけど。\n私達はアイドルなんだから。", "zh": "比起朋友，我觉得现在更要注重在竞争关系上。\n因为我们是偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1066_033sih", "source_sha256": "ba565b93c0a955a593a137c58ca0611fd9303f049692d72f41e6f915310ae111", "ja": "一緒に練習して、私の方が上手くなったらどうするの？\n……可奈は私に曲を取られても、平気なの？", "zh": "要是一起练习，最后我表现比较出色怎么办？\n……难道可奈能够接受新歌被我抢走吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1067_036kan", "source_sha256": "021df99c23b626c3b6b01d0ac4b7fba5dca9d846fc7c14e2380b7c19b4537857", "ja": "それは……やっぱり、ちょっとは……。\nううん、すっごく悔しいかもだけど……。", "zh": "这个……我是有点……\n不，我应该会非常懊悔，可是‥…", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1068_024ann", "source_sha256": "c9685a1b36220ae6c92fa8d36a04cb86bf2763f5ac528998bfd065f9becb896e", "ja": "志保……。杏奈も、可奈と……ライバル……。\nでも……楽しかった……よ？", "zh": "志保……杏奈跟可奈也……是竞争对手……\n可是……很愉快……喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1070_033sih", "source_sha256": "1e1ec68f2bf3777ed35791440c91e84ce3f6ce812c8e1dde99320824cff57b6c", "ja": "それで、どのパートまで進んだの？", "zh": "那你们练到什么部分了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1071_036kan", "source_sha256": "2101051555a859cf269f99bf5ce1d1b3dd64026aa876543e7b64739e4b2e3fa5", "ja": "どのパートって……。えっ？", "zh": "什么部分是指……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1072_033sih", "source_sha256": "eb6099d3aec3073729c0d2f9679e82d50dbf52dba9af6056fab54287d53f0c26", "ja": "どう練習しようと、最後に決めるのは\n{$P$}さんだから。そうですよね？", "zh": "反正不管怎么练习，最后做决定的\n还是{$P$}先生，没有错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1073_p", "source_sha256": "8011dcc1385f75a8f38728e38bb90b5218e11ce7fd450ff0c8a9d6e64cc8db1a", "ja": "そうだな。むしろ一緒に練習してくれた方が、\n俺も公平に見られると思う。", "zh": "没错，你们一起练习的话，\n反而能让我做出更公正的决定。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1074_033sih", "source_sha256": "517dc6bc01198558c63553f750b412b18ed5cd6803db34431a8ad2285411f851", "ja": "わかりました。じゃあ、早く始めましょう。\n私だって……。", "zh": "我明白了，那我们快点开始吧。\n我也一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1075_033sih", "source_sha256": "bd7f26f0235acab91d694daa2705336e764f03196dc53fd0c9b18f209f1199be", "ja": "みんなとのレッスンが大切だってことくらい、\nもう覚えたわ。", "zh": "知道跟大家一起练习的时光，\n有多么重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_016_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_016_1076_036kan", "source_sha256": "1dbaaccd84815e15aec6126455dce4c1a8b48e5bae9520d8acfb87be119e78a4", "ja": "志保ちゃん……！\nうん！　一緒に頑張ろうねっ！", "zh": "志保……！\n嗯！一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
